DECISIONS 203, 182: a go emit in data mode checks its @go(name:) overrides as every mode does (it also has its name plan since M2, E8005_6).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A tone.
enum Tone { a @go(name: "toneA"), b }

emit go { out: "@features/a", package: "a", mode: data }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8011]  a/a.canon:4:13
  toneA is not exported: an @go(name:) override starts with an upper-case letter

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
